This editor is built on top of [CodeMirror](http://codemirror.net/).

## Installation

To install dependencies, `npm install`.

## Development

Run `npm start` to start up a server. Then, open `http://localhost:3000`.

## Deploy

Run `npm run-script build` to build a production version of the app.

## Deploy to GitHub Pages

Run `npm run-script build` to build a production version of the app. If you want to deploy to
GitHub Pages, run `npm run-script deploy` to deploy to `gh-pages` branch.
